.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107132\r\n\r\nThis PR aims to give nice, actionable error messages for the following situations which came up in the above issues:\r\n\r\n1. **WebXR Layers is unsupported or broken.** This one is a little tricky to detect, because, in my testing, I found 3 different ways it could be unsupported/broken. Fortunately, the solution in all cases is to use the WebXR Layers polyfill, which is what the error message suggests\r\n2. **Multiview is not support.**\r\n\r\nI tested on desktop Chrome and Firefox (both on Linux), Android Chrome and the Oculus browser on Meta Quest 3.\r\n\r\n(NOTE: There is a Firefox bug with multiview on Linux with the proprietary nvidia drivers - nothing we can do about that, it'll need to be fixed by nvidia or Firefox)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github